title one tree, one toolchain spawn -- the build lock lands
prompt grant kg -- Keaton granted the %281 word, and the mechanism answer chose itself on every axis over a second checkout.
think The lock lives where the race lives: build_lock_acquire and build_lock_release in rye/src/main.rye, wrapped around the whole bridge -- hit path included, since bridge_rye_tree stages the shared .zig shadows before any receipt is consulted -- and declared ahead of the shadow defers so LIFO releases the lock after their cleanup. A directory as the lock because mkdir is atomic on both kernels; the holder's pid inside so a waiter tells life from corpse; a corpse cleared once; a live holder waited on at a 50 ms poll to a named 600 s bound that refuses with the holder named, because a build held that long is its own question. Three bounds and every choice commented with its why.
think Three house-API seams surfaced while it compiled and each taught: the switch capture |c| shadowed the new std.c import (renamed exit_code); this std spells directory-making createDir with a permissions argument (.default_dir, the mantra room's own idiom); and kill takes its signal as an enum, so the liveness probe is kill(pid, enumFromInt(0)). rye_version bumped to 20260827.023156 and sh rye/bootstrap.sh rebuilt the binary in about a second.
think Proven on metal, all three legs: two concurrent RYE_BUILD_FRESH builds of tally/copy.rye both exited 0 with byte-identical 2,047,064-byte emits and the lock self-cleaned -- the exact race that manufactured %281's false REDs; a planted dead-pid lock was cleared and built through; a live holder was honored (the second build still waiting at two seconds) and freed by the holder's death. The ryekey control re-proved its fifteen legs GREEN over the rebuilt binary.
obs %281 closes on the shadow half; the swept-index half is %255's shape and rides that row. The caravan choir's first sing on this bench runs in the background AS this log is written -- under the lock, beside the live loop, which is the fix proving itself in production on its first night.
obs The next word is already in hand: Oven renames to Kiln as a seated molt-breach-deep-debride arc, checkpoint first -- the following round's own story.
